: true}, "Node name for S&R": "ResolutionSelector"}, "order": 12}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#222", "widgets_values": ["| megapixels | Aspect | Output (multiple=32) |\n|---|---|---|\n| 0.2 | 16:9 | 608 x 352 |\n| 0.3 | 16:9 | 736 x 416 |\n| 0.4 | 16:9 | 864 x 480 |\n| 0.5 | 16:9 | 960 x 544 |\n| 0.6 | 16:9 | 1056 x 608 |\n| 0.7 | 16:9 | 1152 x 640 |\n| 0.8 | 16:9 | 1216 x 672 |\n| 0.9 | 16:9 | 1280 x 736 |\n| 0.98 | 16:9 | 1344 x 768 |\n| 1.0 | 16:9 | 1376 x 768 |\n| 1.2 | 16:9 | 1504 x 832 |\n| 1.5 | 16:9 | 1664 x 928 |\n| 1.8 | 16:9 | 1824 x 1024 |\n| 2.0 | 16:9 | 1920 x 1088 |\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "Note: Size Settings Reference", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [300, 520], "pos": [-1872.062255859375, 4879.2998046875], "id": 140, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 13}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#222", "widgets_values": ["## Model Links\n[🤗 Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3)\n\n**vae**\n\n- [minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors)\n- [minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors)\n\n**diffusion_models**\n\n- [minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/diffusion_models/minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors)\n\n**text_encoders**\n\n- [qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors)\n\n\n## Model Storage Location\n\n```\n📂 ComfyUI/\n├── 📂 models/\n│   ├── 📂 vae/\n│   │   ├── minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors\n│   │   └── minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors\n│   ├── 📂 diffusion_models/\n│   │   └── minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors\n│   └── 📂 text_encoders/\n│       └── qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors\n```\n\n## Report Issue\n\nNote: Please update ComfyUI first ([guide](https://docs.comfy.org/installation/update_comfyui)) and prepare required models. Desktop/Cloud updates follow stable releases, so some nightly-supported models may not be available yet.\n\n- Cannot run / runtime errors: [ComfyUI/issues](https://github.com/comfyanonymous/ComfyUI/issues)\n- UI / frontend issues: [ComfyUI_frontend/issues](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI_frontend/issues)\n- Workflow issues: [workflow_templates/issues](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/issues)\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "Note: Model Links", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [440, 740], "pos": [-2941.731689453125, 4865.501953125], "id": 117, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 14}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#222", "widgets_values": ["MiniMax H3\n\n  MiniMax H3 是 MiniMax 的通用全模态生成模型。它联合理解文本、图像、视频和音频，并生成带有原生立体声音频的视频：语音、音效和音乐在单\n  次前向推理中联合建模，而非事后叠加。输出最高 2K 分辨率、24fps，最长约 15 秒。\n\n  ComfyUI 相关链接\n\n  - ComfyUI#15224\n  - 🤗 Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3\n\n  关于此工作流\n\n  此模板使用 MiniMaxH3ReferenceToVideo 节点运行**参考到视频（ref2va）**任务。它接收任意组合的参考图像、视频和独立音频，将其融入生成\n  过程，以锁定角色身份、风格、动作、运镜或声音。\n\n  关键输入\n\n  - ref_images / ref_videos / ref_video_audios / ref_audios：最多 9 张参考图像、3 段参考视频（每段可携带配对的音轨）和 3\n  段独立参考音频\n  - prompt：按标签引用输入，标签顺序需与连接顺序完全一致，例如 <Picture 1>、<Video 1>、<Audio 1>，然后描述目标场景、动作和音频\n  - ref_image_size：match 将参考缩放到生成分辨率（更快）；max 保留最多 2048px 短边以获得更强的身份保真度，代价是参考 token\n  参与每一步采样，速度更慢\n  - width / height：通过分辨率选择器设置\n  - duration (seconds)：由数学表达式节点转换为合法的帧数 length\n\n  采样与解码\n\n  - 采样器：res_multistep。对于此类参考较多的 prompt，beta 或 normal 调度器通常优于 simple\n  - 采样器输出的联合音频+视频 LATENT 同时送入 VAEDecode（视频，minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16）和\n  VAEDecodeAudio（音频，minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32）；每个解码节点自动从打包的 latent 中提取属于自己的那一半。CreateVideo\n  再将二者合成为带同步音频的单个 MP4\n  - 此处使用的 diffusion model 为 minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors，与 t2v/i2v 模板所用的 fl2va 模型是不同的权重\n\n  Ref2va 的输出对 prompt 措辞极其敏感；精确匹配参考标签，并明确指出哪个参考驱动镜头的哪个部分，往往效果最佳。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "Note: MiniMax H3", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [450, 889.6875], "pos": [-2425.13134765625, 4867.4140625], "id": 116, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 15}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [291], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}], "size": [270, 130], "pos": [1620, 4865.501953125], "widgets_values": [512, 512, 1, 0], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "width"}, "name": "width", "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"widget": {"name": "height"}, "name": "height", "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height"}, {"widget": {"name": "batch_size"}, "name": "batch_size", "label": "batch_size", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "batch_size"}, {"widget": {"name": "color"}, "name": "color", "label": "color", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "color"}], "flags": {}, "id": 145, "type": "EmptyImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "EmptyImage"}, "order": 16}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "label": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}, {"name": "images", "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}], "size": [142.376953125, 46], "pos": [1960, 4865.501953125], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 291, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}], "flags": {}, "id": 146, "type": "PreviewImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PreviewImage"}, "order": 19}], "extra": {"VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "links_added_by_ue": [], "KKvideo_latentpreview": false, "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "ue_links": [], "KKvideo_latentpreviewrate": 0, "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "pixaromaGroups": [], "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "VHS_latentpreview": false, "frontendVersion": "1.23.0", "ds": {"offset": [-391.11111